lution used for hypocaloric peripheral parenteral nutrition.AMINOVEN 3,5%:Aminoven 3,5% is a commercial amino acid solution used for hypocaloric peripheral parenteral nutrition.NUTRIFLEX LIPID:NuTRIflex Lipid is a brand of parenteral nutrition products that includes various formulations for different nutritional needs.SOLUCIONES NITROGENADAS Y LIPÃDICAS:SOLUCIONES NITROGENADAS Y LIPÃDICAS refers to specific formulations designed for parenteral nutrition, which is a method of delivering essential nutrients directly into the bloodstream for patients who are unable to consume food orally. These solutions are crucial for providing nitrogen and lipids, which are vital components necessary for maintaining the nutritional needs of individuals who cannot receive nutrition through the digestive tract.TABLA 4A:Tabla 4A details the manufacturer Braun's products related to parenteral nutrition.NP PERIFÃ‰RICA HIPOCALÃ“RICA:NP perifÃ©rica hipocalÃ³rica refers to a type of parenteral nutrition that is low in calories.KABIVEN CENTRAL:Kabiven Central is a product line from Fresenius Kabi that provides a specific formulation for parenteral nutrition.KABIVEN PERIFERICO:Kabiven PerifÃ©rico is another product line from Fresenius Kabi designed for peripheral parenteral nutrition.OLIGOPLUS:Oligoplus is a product from Fresenius Kabi used as an additive in parenteral nutrition solutions.OLIGOSTANDARD:Oligostandard is another additive product from Fresenius Kabi for parenteral nutrition.SMOFKABIVEN CENTRAL:SmofKabiven Central is a product offered by Fresenius Kabi, designed for parenteral nutrition with specific nutrient compositions.SMOFKABIVEN:SmofKabiven is a nutritional product available in central presentations without electrolytes.OLICLINOMEL:Oliclinomel is a nutritional solution offered in various formulations for peripheral and central administration.ADDITIVOS:Additivos refer to various substances added to nutritional solutions to enhance stability and nutritional value.FRESUBIN PR