tle": "NUTRISON PRE:"}{"title": "SURVIMED OPD HN:"}{"title": "NUTRISON SOYA:Nutrison Soya is a specific product within the Nutrison line, formulated with 100% soy protein for enteral nutrition."}{"title": "ISOSOURCE MIX:"}{"title": "GLUCERNA 1,2:Glucerna 1,2 is a nutritional product designed for individuals with diabetes, providing a specific caloric and nutrient profile."}{"title": "DIBEN 1,5 KCAL HP:Diben 1,5 kcal HP is a high-protein nutritional product designed for patients requiring additional protein intake."}{"title": "NOVASOURCE PEPTIDE PLUS:Novasource Peptide Plus is a specialized enteral formula designed for patients with specific dietary needs."}{"title": "NUTRISON ADVANCED PEPTISORB:Nutrison Advanced Peptisorb is an enteral formula designed for patients with malabsorption issues."}{"title": "PACK 1000 ML, VAINILLA:Pack 1000 ml, Vainilla is a specific product variant of enteral nutrition, flavored with vanilla."}{"title": "HIDROLIZADO DE LACTOALB\u00daMINA:Hidrolizado de Lactoalb\u00famina is a protein source used in enteral formulas, beneficial for patients with specific dietary needs."}{"title": "SUERO L\u00c1CTEO HIDROLIZADO:Suero l\u00e1cteo hidrolizado is a hydrolyzed whey protein used in enteral nutrition for its digestibility and nutritional benefits."}{"title": "DEXTRINOMALTOSA:Dextrinomaltosa is a carbohydrate used in enteral formulas to provide energy and improve digestibility."}{"title": "COLZA, GIRASOL:Colza and Girasol refer to oil sources used in enteral nutrition products for their fat content."}{"title": "OLIGOM\u00c9RICAS:"}{"title": "NUTRISON ADVANCED DIASON:Nutrison Advanced Diason is a specialized nutritional product aimed at providing energy and nutrients for individuals with specific dietary needs."}{"title": "DIETGRIF DIAB\u00c9TICO:Dietgrif diab\u00e9tico is a specialized dietary product designed for diabetic patients, emphasizing low-calorie and low-sugar formulations to support their nutritional needs. It is available in a variety of flavors, catering to the preferences of individuals managing diabetes while ensuring they receive appropriate nutrition."}{"title": "PROTE\u00cdNA DE SUERO:Prote\u00edna de suero, or whey protein, is a fast-digesting protein commonly used in dietary supplements for muscle building and recovery."}{"title": "B.BRAUN:B.Braun is a global medical and pharmaceutical company that offers various healthcare products."}{"title": "DIABA:Diaba is a dietary product aimed at managing diabetes through controlled nutrition."}{"title": "NUTRISON ADVANCED DIASON LOW ENERGY:Nutrison Advanced Diason Low Energy is a specialized nutritional formula for patients requiring low-energy diets."}{"title": "NOVASOURCE GI PROTEIN:Novasource GI Protein is a high-protein nutritional product designed for patients with gastrointestinal issues."}{"title": "NOVASOURCE GI CONTROL:Novasource GI Control is a nutritional product aimed at managing gastrointestinal disorders."}{"title": "DIEMAT G:Diemat G is a nutritional formula designed for patients with hepatic encephalopathy."}{"title": "NUTRICOMP HEPPA:Nutricomp Hepa is a specialized nutritional product for patients with liver insufficiency."}{"title": "DEXTRINA DE TAPIOCA:Dextrina de tapioca is a carbohydrate derived from tapioca, often used as a thickening agent in dietary products."}{"title": "CELULOSA:Celulosa is a form of dietary fiber utilized in nutritional products and various food items. It is primarily known for its role in aiding digestion and improving the texture of food products, while also providing health benefits."}{"title": "MF6 MULTIFIBRE:MF6 Multifibre is a blend of fibers used in nutritional products to enhance digestive health."}{"title": "POLISAC\u00c1RIDOS DE SOJA:Polisac\u00e1ridos de soja are complex carbohydrates derived from soy, used for their nutritional benefits."}{"title": "HIDROLIZADA:Hidrolizada refers to hydrolyzed proteins, which are broken down for easier digestion and absorption."}{"title": "BOLSA 500 ML NEUTRO BOTELLA 500 ML CHOCOLATE:A product event related to the nutritional formula Bolsa 500 ml Neutro Botella 500 ml Chocolate, which contains various amino acids and ingredients for dietary use."}{"title": "INSUFICIENCIA RESPIRATORIA CR\u00d3NICA:A medical condition related to chronic respiratory failure, for which Pulmocare is a nutritional product designed to support patients."}{"title": "PULMOCARE:Pulmocare is a nutritional product by Abbott specifically formulated for patients with chronic respiratory insufficiency."}{"title": "INTESTAMIN:Intestamin is a nutritional product by Fresenius Kabi designed for immunomodulatory purposes."}{"title": "AT\u00c9MPEIRO ENTERAL:At\u00e9mpero Enteral is a nutritional product by Vegenat designed for enteral feeding."}{"title": "SUPPORTAN:Supportan is a nutritional product by Fresenius Kabi designed for dietary support."}{"title": "CALCIUM-SANDOZ:Calcium-Sandoz is a brand of calcium supplements that provide essential calcium for bone health."}{"title": "NUTRISON MCT:Nutrison MCT is a nutritional product designed for patients requiring a high-fat diet, particularly those with malabsorption issues."}{"title": "CIMASCAL:Cimascal is a brand of calcium supplements that provide essential calcium for bone health."}{"title": "TARDYFERON:Tardyferon is a brand of iron supplements used to treat iron deficiency anemia."}{"title": "FOSFATO S\u00d3DICO MONOB\u00c1SICO NM:Fosfato S\u00f3dico Monob\u00e1sico NM is a nutritional supplement that provides phosphorus, essential for various bodily functions."}{"title": "CROMATONBIC FERRO:Cromatonbic Ferro is a brand of oral iron supplements used to treat iron deficiency."}{"title": "VENOFER:Venofer is an intravenous iron supplement used to treat iron deficiency anemia in patients who cannot take oral iron."}{"title": "FERINJECT:Ferinject is a brand of iron carboxymaltose solution specifically designed for intravenous iron therapy. It contains 50 mg of iron per ml and serves as an intravenous iron supplement that delivers a high dose of iron to patients suffering from iron deficiency."}{"title": "HIERRO ORAL:Refers to the category of oral iron supplements used to treat iron deficiency anemia."}{"title": "HIERRO INTRAVENOSO:Refers to the category of intravenous iron supplements used to treat iron deficiency anemia."}{"title": "SUPRESSI NP:Supressi NP is a nutritional product that offers a plant-based alternative for dietary needs."}{"title": "LIMITACI\u00d3N DE INGESTA GRASA:Refers to dietary guidelines or restrictions regarding fat intake for health management."}{"title": "MALTODEXTRINA MODIFICADA:Maltodextrina Modificada is a carbohydrate used in nutritional products to provide energy."}{"title": "VIT B:Vitamin B refers to a group of vitamins that are essential for various metabolic processes in the body."}{"title": "COLINA:Choline is a nutrient that is important for liver function, brain development, and muscle movement."}{"title": "GANGLIOSIDOS:Gangliosides are a type of glycosphingolipid that play a role in cell signaling and are included in some nutritional products."}{"title": "COSMOFER:CosmoFer is a brand of iron hydroxide dextran complex used for intravenous iron supplementation, containing 50 mg of iron per ml."}{"title": "MONOFERRO:Monoferro is a brand of iron isomaltoside solution used for iron therapy, containing 100 mg of iron per ml."}{"title": "MAGNOGENE:Magnogene is a coated magnesium supplement that provides 53 mg of magnesium from a combination of magnesium hydroxide and magnesium bromide."}{"title": "MAGNESIO NM:Magnesio NM is a magnesium supplement available in both powder and capsule forms, providing various dosages of magnesium."}{"title": "SULMET\u00cdN SIMPLE:Sulmet\u00edn Simple is a magnesium sulfate supplement available in ampoules, providing 1500 mg of magnesium."}{"title": "BOI-K ASP\u00c1RTICO:Boi-K Asp\u00e1rtico is a potassium supplement in effervescent tablet form, containing 975 mg of potassium."}{"title": "BOI-K:Boi-K is a potassium supplement in effervescent tablet form, containing 390 mg of potassium."}{"title": "POTASI\u00d3N:Potasi\u00f3n is a potassium supplement available in capsule form, containing 314.69 mg of potassium."}{"title": "CLORURO POT\u00c1SICO IV:Cloruro Pot\u00e1sico IV is a potassium supplement available in injectable form, providing various concentrations of potassium."}{"title": "POTASIO NM:Potasio NM is a potassium supplement that provides 944.06 mg of potassium in a convenient powder form."}{"title": "SELENIO NM:Selenio NM is a selenium supplement that provides 0.109 mg of sodium selenite per capsule."}{"title": "SULFATO DE ZINC NM:Sulfato de Zinc NM is a zinc supplement that provides 41 mg of zinc per capsule."}{"title": "ZINC + NM:Zinc + NM is a zinc supplement that provides 83.91 mg of zinc per capsule."}{"title": "MAGNESIOBOI:"}{"title": "BENERVA 100 MG/ML:Benerva 100 mg/ml is a solution that contains 100 mg of Vitamin B1 per 1 ml ampoule, used for injection."}{"title": "BENERVA 300 MG:Benerva 300 mg is a coated tablet that contains 300 mg of thiamine hydrochloride, used for dietary supplementation."}{"title": "CROMATONBIC B12 1000:Cromatonbic B12 1000 is an injectable solution containing 1000 \u03bcg of cyanocobalamin (Vitamin B12) per ampoule."}{"title": "OPTOVITE B12:Optovite B12 is an injectable solution containing 1000 \u03bcg of cyanocobalamin (Vitamin B12) per ampoule, used for dietary supplementation."}{"title": "MEGAMILBEDOCE 10000:Megamilbedoce 10000 is an injectable solution containing 10,000 \u03bcg of hydroxocobalamin (Vitamin B12) per 2 ml ampoule."}{"title": "BENAD\u00d3N 300 MG:Benad\u00f3n 300 mg is a coated tablet that contains 300 mg of pyridoxine hydrochloride (Vitamin B6), used for dietary supplementation."}{"title": "ACFOL 5 MG:Acfol 5 mg is a tablet that contains 5 mg of folic acid, used for dietary supplementation."}{"title": "BIALFOLI 5 MG:Bialfoli 5 mg is a tablet that contains 5 mg of folic acid, used for dietary supplementation."}{"title": "ZOLICO 400:Zolico 400 is a tablet that contains 400 \u03bcg of folic acid, used for dietary supplementation."}{"title": "\u00c1CIDO ASC\u00d3RBICO BAYER 1000 MG/ML:\u00c1cido Asc\u00f3rbico Bayer 1000 mg/ml is an injectable solution containing 1000 mg of ascorbic acid (Vitamin C) per 5 ml ampoule."}{"title": "REDOXC 500 MG:Redoxc 500 mg is a chewable tablet containing 500 mg of ascorbic acid (Vitamin C)."}{"title": "DELTIUS 25000 UI/2,5 ML:Deltius 25000 UI/2,5 ml is an oral solution containing 25,000 UI of cholecalciferol (Vitamin D3) per 2.5 ml bottle."}{"title": "VITAMINA D3 KERN PHARMA 2000 UI/ML:Vitamina D3 Kern Pharma 2000 UI/ml is an oral solution containing 2,000 UI of cholecalciferol (Vitamin D3) per ml."}{"title": "HIDROFEROL CHOQUE 3 MG:Hidroferol Choque 3 mg is an oral solution containing 3 mg of calcifediol (180,000 UI of 25-OH-Vitamin D3) per ampoule."}{"title": "HIDROFEROL 0,1 MG/ML:Hidroferol 0,1 mg/ml is an oral solution containing 0.1 mg (100 \u03bcg) of calcifediol (6,000 UI of 25-OH-Vitamin D3) per ml."}{"title": "HIDROFEROL 0,266 MG:Hidroferol 0,266 mg is an oral solution containing 0.266 mg (266 \u03bcg) of calcifediol (25-OH-Vitamin D3) per ampoule or tablet."}{"title": "ROCALTROL:Rocaltrol is a soft capsule containing 0.25 or 0.50 \u03bcg of calcitriol (1,25-(OH)2-Vitamin D3)."}{"title": "CALCITRIOL 1 \u039cG/ML:Calcitriol 1 \u03bcg/ml is an injectable solution containing 1 \u03bcg of calcitriol per ml."}{"title": "AUXINA A MASIVA:"}{"title": "AUXINA E-50:Auxina E-50 is a vitamin E supplement containing 50 mg of dl-alfa tocoferil acetato, equivalent to 50 UI of vitamin E, presented in soft capsules."}{"title": "AUXINA E-200:Auxina E-200 is a vitamin E supplement containing 200 mg of dl-alfa tocoferil acetato, equivalent to 200 UI of vitamin E, presented in soft capsules."}{"title": "AUXINA E-400:Auxina E-400 is a vitamin E supplement containing 400 mg of dl-alfa tocoferil acetato, equivalent to 400 UI of vitamin E, presented in soft capsules."}{"title": "MEDEBIOT\u00cdN FUERTE:Medebiot\u00edn Fuerte is a biotin supplement providing 5 mg of biotin per tablet."}{"title": "MEDEBIOT\u00cdN SOL. INY.:Medebiot\u00edn Sol. Iny. is a biotin supplement that contains 5 mg of biotin sodium per 1 ml ampoule, suitable for oral, intramuscular, or intravenous use."}{"title": "KONAKI\u00d3N 10 MG/ML:Konaki\u00f3n 10 mg/ml is a vitamin K1 supplement containing 10 mg of fitomenadiona in 1 ml, available in ampoules for oral or intravenous use."}{"title": "KONAKI\u00d3N 2 MG/0,2 ML PED.:Konaki\u00f3n 2 mg/0,2 ml PED. is a vitamin K1 supplement containing 2 mg of fitomenadiona in 0.2 ml, available in ampoules for oral, intramuscular, or intravenous use."}{"title": "BIALFER COMP.:Bialfer comp. is a supplement that contains 1 mg of iron, designed to support iron levels in the body."}{"title": "BOI-K ASP\u00c1RTICO COMP. EFERV.:Boi-K Asp\u00e1rtico comp. eferv. is an effervescent potassium supplement, providing 25 mEq of potassium per serving."}{"title": "BOI-K COMP. EFERV.:Boi-K comp. eferv. is an effervescent potassium supplement, providing 10 mEq of potassium per serving."}{"title": "CARBONATO CA + VITAMINA D3 COMP.:Carbonato Ca + vitamina D3 comp. is a calcium and vitamin D3 supplement, providing 400-880 UI of vitamin D3 and 500-1500 mg of calcium."}{"title": "CELEBRATE CALCIUM PLUS COMP.:Celebrate Calcium Plus comp. is a calcium supplement that provides 500 mg of calcium and 333 UI of vitamin D3."}{"title": "CELEBRATE IRON + C COMP.:Celebrate Iron + C comp. is a supplement that contains 36 mg of iron and is designed to enhance iron absorption with vitamin C."}{"title": "ELEVIT COMP.:Elevit comp. is a comprehensive multivitamin supplement providing various vitamins and minerals, including 3,600 UI of vitamin A and 1,55 mg of vitamin B1."}{"title": "VITAMINA H:Vitamin H, also known as Biotin, is a water-soluble B-vitamin that plays a key role in the metabolism of fats, carbohydrates, and proteins."}{"title": "VITAMINA B3:Vitamin B3, also known as Niacin, is a water-soluble vitamin that helps convert food into energy and is important for DNA repair."}{"title": "VITAMINA B5:Vitamin B5, also known as Pantothenic Acid, is a water-soluble vitamin essential for the synthesis of coenzyme A, important in fatty acid metabolism."}{"title": "CUPRO:Copper is a trace mineral that is important for iron metabolism and the formation of red blood cells."}{"title": "FISIOGEN FERRO:Fisiogen Ferro is a company that produces iron supplements in capsule form."}{"title": "FISIOGEN FERRO FORTE:Fisiogen Ferro Forte is a product line from Fisiogen that offers iron supplements in capsules and sachets."}{"title": "FOLIFERR\u00d3N:Foliferr\u00f3n is a brand of dietary supplements that includes folic acid and iron."}{"title": "HIDROPOLIVIT A MINERAL:Hidropolivit A Mineral is a product that combines various vitamins and minerals in a chewable format."}{"title": "LUNAFEM:Lunafem is a dietary supplement designed for women's health, providing essential vitamins and minerals."}{"title": "MICEBRINA UNA AL D\u00cdA:Micebrina Una al D\u00eda is a daily multivitamin supplement that includes a variety of essential nutrients."}{"title": "MULTICENTRUM:Multicentrum is a well-known brand of multivitamins that provides a comprehensive range of vitamins and minerals."}{"title": "NATIFAR:Natifar is a dietary supplement that includes various vitamins and minerals."}{"title": "NATIMED:Natimed is a brand that offers dietary supplements, focusing on vitamins and minerals."}{"title": "NORMOVITE ANTIAN\u00c9MICO:Normovite Antian\u00e9mico is a product designed to combat anemia through a combination of vitamins and minerals."}{"title": "PHARMATON COMPLEX:Pharmaton Complex is a dietary supplement that combines vitamins, minerals, and ginseng for overall health support."}{"title": "REDOXON COMPLEX:Redoxon Complex is a vitamin supplement designed to enhance overall health and support the immune system. It contains a variety of essential vitamins and minerals, prominently featuring Vitamin C and Vitamin D, along with other vital nutrients. This formulation aims to provide comprehensive nutritional support, making it beneficial for individuals seeking to improve their health and bolster their immune defenses."}{"title": "OLIGOELEMENTS:Oligoelements are trace elements that are necessary for various physiological functions and are included in many dietary supplements."}{"title": "SUPRADYN ACTIVO:Supradyn Activo is a multivitamin supplement designed to support energy levels and overall well-being, containing a range of vitamins and minerals."}{"title": "YODOCEFOL COMP.:Yodocefol comp. is a vitamin supplement that provides essential vitamins, particularly focusing on iodine and folic acid."}{"title": "YODUK COMPLEX COMP.:Yoduk Complex comp. is a dietary supplement that includes iodine and other vitamins, aimed at supporting thyroid function."}{"title": "YOFOLVIT COMP.:Yofolvit comp. is a vitamin supplement that provides essential nutrients, particularly focusing on folic acid and iodine."}{"title": "ANTINEURINA:Antineurina is a vitamin supplement that contains a combination of B vitamins, aimed at supporting nerve health."}{"title": "AUXINA A+E:Auxina A+E is a vitamin supplement that combines vitamins A and E, aimed at promoting skin and eye health."}{"title": "BECOZYME C FORTE:Becozyme C Forte is a vitamin supplement that provides a combination of B vitamins and Vitamin C, aimed at enhancing energy and immune function."}{"title": "BENEXOL:Benexol is a vitamin B complex supplement that includes B1, B6, and B12, aimed at supporting energy metabolism and nerve function."}{"title": "CELEBRATE B12:Celebrate B12 is a sublingual vitamin B12 supplement aimed at supporting energy levels and red blood cell production."}{"title": "CERNEVIT:Cernevit is a multivitamin supplement administered intravenously, providing essential vitamins for patients unable to take oral supplements."}{"title": "DYNAMIN COMP.:Dynamin comp. is a vitamin supplement that includes various vitamins, aimed at supporting overall health."}{"title": "FOLI-DOCE COMP.:Foli-doce comp. is a vitamin supplement that focuses on providing folic acid and other essential vitamins."}{"title": "HIDROXIL:Hidroxil is a vitamin B complex supplement aimed at supporting energy metabolism and overall health."}{"title": "NERVOBI\u00d3N:Nervobi\u00f3n is a pharmaceutical product administered via injection, containing 100 mg of active ingredients. It serves as a vitamin supplement that includes B vitamins, specifically designed to support nerve health and function."}{"title": "NEURODAVUR:Neurodavur is a pharmaceutical product available in capsule form, containing 250 mg of active ingredients. It is designed as a vitamin supplement that provides a combination of vitamins aimed at supporting neurological health."}{"title": "NEUROMADE:Neuromade is a pharmaceutical product available in capsule form, containing 50 mg of active ingredients. It is also described as a vitamin supplement that includes various vitamins, aimed at supporting overall health and well-being. This dual characterization suggests that Neuromade serves both as a medication and a dietary supplement, contributing to both health management and nutritional support."}{"title": "BECOME C FORTE:"}{"title": "VITAMIN B1:Vitamin B1, also known as thiamine, is a B vitamin that plays a crucial role in energy metabolism and nerve function."}{"title": "VITAMIN B3:Vitamin B3, also known as niacin, is a B vitamin that supports metabolism and DNA repair."}{"title": "VITAMIN B5:Vitamin B5, or pantothenic acid, is a B vitamin essential for the synthesis of coenzyme A and fatty acid metabolism."}{"title": "VITAMIN D3:Vitamin D3 is a form of vitamin D that is important for calcium absorption and bone health."}{"title": "POLI A*B*E5:Poli A*B*E5 is a pharmaceutical product containing 50 mg and 50 UI of active ingredients."}{"title": "PROTOVIT:Protovit is a pharmaceutical product available in drops, containing various dosages of active ingredients."}{"title": "REVIT NM:Revit NM is a pharmaceutical product available in capsule form, containing 60 mg and 500 \u03bcg of active ingredients."}{"title": "SOLUVIT:Soluvit is a pharmaceutical product administered via intravenous injection, containing various dosages of active ingredients."}{"title": "D2:VITALIPID:D2:Vitalipid is a pharmaceutical product that is administered via intravenous injection. It contains 330 UI along with other dosages of active ingredients."}{"title": "INJECTION:The process of administering medication via injection, as seen with products like Nervobi\u00f3n and Soluvit."}{"title": "CAPSULE:The form in which medications like Neurodavur and Neuromade are delivered, typically for oral consumption."}{"title": "DROPS:The method of delivering medication in liquid form, as seen with Protovit.)<|COMPLETE|>"}À…+␀␀␀␀␀`†+␀␀␀␀␀Ï†+␀␀␀␀␀L‡+␀␀␀␀␀2ˆ+␀␀␀␀␀¯ˆ+␀␀␀␀␀×ˆ+␀␀␀␀␀^‰+␀␀␀␀␀ó‰+␀␀␀␀␀OŠ+␀␀␀␀␀¦Š+␀␀␀␀␀‹+␀␀␀␀␀n‹+␀␀␀␀␀Œ+␀␀␀␀␀ Œ+␀␀␀␀␀7+␀␀␀␀␀Â+␀␀␀␀␀O+␀␀␀␀␀ +␀␀␀␀␀4+␀␀␀␀␀Ë+␀␀␀␀␀d‘+␀␀␀␀␀ğ‘+␀␀␀␀␀|’+␀␀␀␀␀“+␀␀␀␀␀Â“+␀␀␀␀␀f”+␀␀␀␀␀•+␀␀␀␀␀™•+␀␀␀␀␀0–+␀␀␀␀␀Ê–+␀␀␀␀␀d—+␀␀␀␀␀ş—+␀␀␀␀␀™˜+␀␀␀␀␀ã™+␀␀␀␀␀”›+␀␀␀␀␀½›+␀␀␀␀␀ã›+␀␀␀␀␀p+␀␀␀␀␀J +␀␀␀␀␀\¢+␀␀␀␀␀g£+␀␀␀␀␀r¤+␀␀␀␀␀†¥+␀␀␀␀␀ğ¥+␀␀␀␀␀j¦+␀␀␀␀␀æ¦+␀␀␀␀␀b§+␀␀␀␀␀Ş§+␀␀␀␀␀Z¨+␀␀␀␀␀Î¨+␀␀␀␀␀^ª+␀␀␀␀␀Z¬+␀␀␀␀␀Ï¬+␀␀␀␀␀S­+␀␀␀␀␀Ù­+␀␀␀␀␀_®+␀␀␀␀␀å®+␀␀␀␀␀k¯+␀␀␀␀␀ì¯+␀␀␀␀␀]°+␀␀␀␀␀²+␀␀␀␀␀”²+␀␀␀␀␀³+␀␀␀␀␀’³+␀␀␀␀␀´+␀␀␀␀␀©´+␀␀␀␀␀7µ+␀␀␀␀␀Áµ+␀␀␀␀␀W¶+␀␀␀␀␀ã¶+␀␀␀␀␀g·+␀␀␀␀␀ê·+␀␀␀␀␀j¹+␀␀␀␀␀å¹+␀␀␀␀␀iº+␀␀␀␀␀íº+␀␀␀␀␀Ó»+␀␀␀␀␀½+␀␀␀␀␀¿+␀␀␀␀␀Á+␀␀␀␀␀©Â+␀␀␀␀␀>Ä+␀␀␀␀␀Æ+␀␀␀␀␀Æ+␀␀␀␀␀È+␀␀␀␀␀uÉ+␀␀␀␀␀ùÉ+␀␀␀␀␀vÊ+␀␀␀␀␀Ë+␀␀␀␀␀Ë+␀␀␀␀␀µË+␀␀␀␀␀KÌ+␀␀␀␀␀ÂÌ+␀␀␀␀␀OÍ+␀␀␀␀␀éÍ+␀␀␀␀␀‚Î+␀␀␀␀␀Ï+␀␀␀␀␀«Ï+␀␀␀␀␀<Ğ+␀␀␀␀␀ÛĞ+␀␀␀␀␀iÑ+␀␀␀␀␀îÑ+␀␀␀␀␀
